From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Heidelberg <david@ixit.cz>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 16:05:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] arm64: dts: qcom: sdm845-google: Enable vbus support

On this device, vbus was setup and switched off by the charger driver.
Enable proper driver.

Signed-off-by: David Heidelberg <david@ixit.cz>

[nura-builds: adapted to the sdm845-7.1-rc1 tree, after the Type-C node of the Type-C RFC]
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-google-common.dtsi | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-google-common.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-google-common.dtsi
index d4a0c6051..b0eafb7d4 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-google-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-google-common.dtsi
@@ -709,6 +709,13 @@ pmi8998_typec_mux_in: endpoint {
 	};
 };
 
+&pmi8998_vbus {
+	regulator-min-microamp = <500000>;
+	regulator-max-microamp = <1500000>;
+
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &pmi8998_fg {
 	monitored-battery = <&battery>;
 	power-supplies = <&pmi8998_charger>;
